### 销售合同 API 测试文件
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件运行

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@userId = test-user-123

### ==================== 健康检查 ====================

### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### ==================== 客户管理 ====================

### 创建客户（用于测试）
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "code": "C001",
  "name": "测试客户公司",
  "shortName": "测试客户",
  "stage": "FORMAL",
  "isForeign": false,
  "currency": "USD",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### ==================== 销售合同 ====================

### 1. 创建销售合同（带明细）
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "code": "SC202602001",
  "customerId": "请替换为实际的客户ID",
  "customerCode": "C001",
  "customerName": "测试客户公司",
  "customerPoNo": "PO-2026-001",
  "currency": "USD",
  "totalAmount": 50000.00,
  "salesPerson": "张三",
  "merchandiser": "李四",
  "buyer": "王五",
  "priceTerms": "FOB",
  "transportMethod": "SEA",
  "departurePortName": "上海港",
  "destinationPortName": "洛杉矶港",
  "contractType": "DOMESTIC",
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "产品A",
      "productCode": "P001",
      "productSpec": "规格A",
      "quantity": 1000,
      "unit": "PCS",
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "currency": "USD",
      "amount": 50000.00,
      "boxes": 20,
      "grossWeight": 1000.5,
      "netWeight": 900.0,
      "volume": 10.5,
      "deliveryDate": "2026-03-01"
    }
  ]
}

### 2. 获取销售合同列表（分页）
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts?page=1&pageSize=20

### 3. 搜索销售合同
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts?search=SC2026&status=DRAFT

### 4. 获取销售合同详情
# @name getSalesContract
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID

### 5. 根据编号获取销售合同
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/code/SC202602001

### 6. 更新销售合同
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "totalAmount": 55000.00,
  "remark": "客户要求增加数量",
  "container20ft": 2,
  "estimatedFreight": 3000.00
}

### 7. 审核销售合同（通过）
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: manager-123

{
  "approved": true
}

### 8. 审核销售合同（拒绝）
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: manager-123

{
  "approved": false
}

### 9. 确认销售合同
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/confirm
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 10. 更新合同状态
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### 11. 回签
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/sign-back
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "signBackDate": "2026-02-08T10:00:00Z",
  "signBackDescription": "客户已确认并回签",
  "signBackAttachments": [
    "https://example.com/签字文件.pdf"
  ]
}

### 12. 打印合同
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/print
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 13. 转采购计划
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/to-purchase-plan
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 14. 删除销售合同（软删除）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### ==================== 销售合同明细 ====================

### 15. 获取明细列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/items

### 16. 添加明细行
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为实际ID/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "productName": "产品B",
  "productCode": "P002",
  "productSpec": "规格B",
  "quantity": 500,
  "unit": "PCS",
  "unitPrice": 30.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "boxes": 10,
  "grossWeight": 500.5,
  "netWeight": 450.0,
  "volume": 5.5,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-03-15",
  "remark": "新增产品"
}

### 17. 更新明细行
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为合同ID/items/请替换为明细ID
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "quantity": 600,
  "amount": 18000.00,
  "remark": "数量调整"
}

### 18. 删除明细行
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/请替换为合同ID/items/请替换为明细ID
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### ==================== 统计分析 ====================

### 19. 获取统计数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/statistics?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31

### 20. 按客户统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/statistics?customerId=请替换为客户ID&startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31

### ==================== 复杂查询示例 ====================

### 查询已审核的标准合同
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts?approvalStatus=APPROVED&contractType=STANDARD&page=1&pageSize=20

### 查询特定日期范围的合同
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-03-31&page=1

### 查询特定客户的所有合同
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts?customerId=请替换为客户ID&page=1&pageSize=50

### ==================== 完整业务流程示例 ====================

### Step 1: 创建草稿
# @name createContract
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: sales-rep-001

{
  "code": "SC202602002",
  "customerId": "customer-id-123",
  "customerCode": "C001",
  "customerName": "ABC公司",
  "customerPoNo": "PO-2026-002",
  "currency": "USD",
  "totalAmount": 100000.00,
  "salesPerson": "销售员A",
  "merchandiser": "跟单员B",
  "contractType": "JOINT_VENTURE",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "主打产品",
      "quantity": 2000,
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "amount": 100000.00
    }
  ]
}

### Step 2: 提交审核
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/{{createContract.response.body.data.id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: manager-001

{
  "approved": true
}

### Step 3: 客户确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/{{createContract.response.body.data.id}}/confirm
X-User-Id: sales-rep-001

### Step 4: 开始执行
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/{{createContract.response.body.data.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: sales-rep-001

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Step 5: 客户回签
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/{{createContract.response.body.data.id}}/sign-back
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: sales-rep-001

{
  "signBackDescription": "客户已确认"
}

### Step 6: 转采购计划
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/{{createContract.response.body.data.id}}/to-purchase-plan
X-User-Id: sales-rep-001

### Step 7: 查看最终状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-contracts/{{createContract.response.body.data.id}}
